 period." :question/worked-solution "Let's plot the graph of $y=\\tan x.$\n\n![](images/e6/e65a2728d8bdad40af736ced1ec8303bf10fb4d11fc66b33784663512093a26b.png)\n\nLet's go through each statement.\n\n- Statement I is true. The function is defined everywhere except where $x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}+n\\pi.$\n\n- Statement II is false. The function is positive on $(0,\\frac{\\pi}{2})$ and negative on $(-\\frac{\\pi}{2},0).$ The period is $\\pi,$ so these signs repeat after each integer multiple of $\\pi.$\n\n- Statement III is false. The graph repeats after a horizontal shift of $\\pi,$ and no smaller positive shift repeats the whole graph. Therefore, the least positive period is $\\pi.$\n\nSo, the correct answer is \"I only\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186515981 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "59e0e97e-5cea-5f1e-8e24-1bc56a216407" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186515939} {:answer/id #uuid "cdb4548a-d120-590b-a1a0-91a4dd318d6f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186515988}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "cdb4548a-d120-590b-a1a0-91a4dd318d6f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186515988} :answer-field/id #uuid "15f45d56-bc6a-56f7-8662-5c8c4c1866d2" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186515921} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3099072b-d865-56fd-a07b-65485f9ab3fe" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186515925} {:answer/id #uuid "7a4d0829-1306-5cd7-8234-055b6f739d30" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186515953}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3099072b-d865-56fd-a07b-65485f9ab3fe" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186515925} :answer-field/id #uuid 